urse is designed for those who want to work on the process of building, testing, and delivering software in a smooth and organized way. It helps you understand how applications move from development to live environments without delays or errors.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This field is suitable if you are interested in automation, system coordination, and improving how software is released and maintained.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Demand for DevOps Professionals<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>The demand for DevOps professionals is increasing as companies focus on faster software delivery and better system management. The global DevOps market was valued at around $10.4 billion in 2023 and is expected to grow to nearly <a href=\"https:\/\/www.marketsandmarkets.com\/Market-Reports\/devops-market-824.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">$25.5 billion by 2028<\/a>, showing steady growth in this field.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Top Roles After Completing a DevOps Course in Nagpur<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>A DevOps background opens up roles that focus on improving how software is built, deployed, and maintained in real environments.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Job Role<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Responsibilities<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>DevOps Engineer<\/td><td>Manage application delivery processes and ensure smooth coordination between development and operations.<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Build and Release Engineer<\/td><td>Oversee software builds, version control, and timely release of applications<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Automation Engineer<\/td><td>Develop scripts and tools to reduce manual work and improve system efficiency.<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Site Reliability Engineer (SRE)<\/td><td>Maintain system stability, monitor performance, and reduce downtime<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Salary After Completing a DevOps Course in Nagpur<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>The <a href=\"https:\/\/www.glassdoor.co.in\/Salaries\/n%C4%81gpur-maharashtra-devops-engineer-salary-SRCH_IL.0,18_IC2951950_KO19,34.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">salary range<\/a> below helps you understand how earnings in DevOps grow as you gain experience, improve your technical skills, and work on real deployment and automation projects:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Experience Level<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Average Annual Salary<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Entry Level (0 &#8211; 1 Years)<\/td><td>\u20b95.76 LPA &#8211; \u20b96.24 LPA<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Mid-Level (4 &#8211; 6 Years)<\/td><td>\u20b93 LPA &#8211; \u20b98 LPA<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Senior Level (7+ Years)<\/td><td>\u20b99 LPA &#8211; \u20b915+ LPA<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Top Companies Hiring DevOps Professionals in Nagpur<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Nagpur has a growing IT ecosystem where companies are adopting cloud and automation practices, creating demand for DevOps roles. Some of the companies that have a presence in Nagpur include InfoCepts, Persistent Systems, GlobalLogic, and TCS (Tata Consultancy Services).&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>These organizations work on software, cloud, and data projects where DevOps skills are required.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Become a DevOps Engineer in Nagpur<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Below are the steps to help you get started:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Learn Basic Programming and Scripting:<\/strong> Start with languages like <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/python\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Python<\/a> or shell scripting to understand automation and basic development tasks.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Understand Operating Systems:<\/strong> Get familiar with Linux systems, as most DevOps environments work on Linux-based servers.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Learn Version Control Systems:<\/strong> Understand tools like Git to manage code changes and collaborate with development teams.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Join a DevOps Course:<\/strong> Enroll in a structured course in Nagpur to get guided learning, practical exposure, and real project experience.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Learn CI\/CD Concepts:<\/strong> Understand how applications are built, tested, and deployed using continuous integration and deployment pipelines.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Work with Cloud Platforms:<\/strong> Gain basic knowledge of cloud services like AWS or Azure to manage deployment environments.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Practice with Real Projects:<\/strong> Set up small projects to understand automation, deployment, and system monitoring.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Build a Portfolio:<\/strong> Showcase your work, tools, and setups to highlight your skills to employers.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Apply for Internships and Jobs:<\/strong> Look for entry-level roles in Nagpur-based companies to gain hands-on experience.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/full-stack-developer-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=Content_Banner&amp;utm_campaign=SEO&amp;utm_page=\/it-courses-nagpur\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\" noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1546\" height=\"452\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/full-stack-development-course.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-13736\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/full-stack-development-course.webp 1546w,